## Communication protocol

### Blocking questions
Post a comment beginning with `BLOCKER:` only when one of these is true:
- proceeding risks data loss, security weakening or incompatible migration;
- a product decision materially changes user behavior;
- required credentials/infrastructure are unavailable;
- two requirements directly conflict.

Stop only the affected unit. Continue independent work.

### Non-blocking questions
Post a comment beginning with `ASSUMPTION:`, state the proposed choice and continue with the safest reversible implementation unless instructed otherwise.

### Completion report
Post:
- root cause;
- files changed;
- migrations/configuration;
- tests and build results;
- deployment status;
- remaining limitations;
- exact live verification steps.

